  "text": "Chest pain, heart palpitations, rapid heart rate, high blood pressure, nausea.\nWas taken to the ER for major chest pain, admitted overnight for observation and spent tens of thousands of $'s on heart scans, etc.\nStopped taking and switched to another similar medication.\nExperienced constant nausea, dizziness, heart palpitations, \"brain zaps\" (feeling of an electrical pulse in my head when I turn my head or move my eyes), constant ringing in my ears, mood swings, irritability, increased anxiety and much more.\nWould not recommend this medication to anybody!\nHave felt awful for 2 weeks so far and have been told by others that these symptoms may last for months to come.\n",
